{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Nobody's dying if we can help it.\nWe can protect you.": "",
  "Nobody's dying if we can help it.\nWe'll protect you.": "",
  "Don't you understand?\nNo matter what I say, you can't win this trial!": "",
  "I told you, you can't win this trial!\nMy testimony won't do a thing!": "",
  "But if I open my mouth... I'll have to live the rest of my\nlife in fear. Until the day they finally finish the job.": "",
  "But if I open my mouth... I'll have to live the rest of my life\nin fear. Until they eventually catch up.": "",
  "How can we change your mind?\nYou're in the middle of this whole AD-9 mess.": "",
  "How can we change your mind?\nYou're at the heart of AD-9 itself.": "",
  "But you never actually killed anyone yourself.\nWe might be able to argue for a lighter sentence.": "",
  "But you never killed anyone yourself.\nMaybe we can get you a lighter sentence.": "",
  "Absolutely not! You can't convince me\nto sign my own death warrant!": "",
  "Absolutely not! You can't convince me to\nsign my own death warrant!": "",
  "Did you talk to Ichinose after Kuroiwa\nrescued you from the arcade?": "",
  "Did you talk to Ichinose?\nAfter Kuroiwa saved you from Charles?": "",
  "I have nothing to say about that.\nNow leave me alone.": "",
  "I have nothing to say about that.\nNow... please leave me alone.": "",
  "Dammit, we're not getting anywhere.": "",
  "You shouldn't fight a battle you can't win. I would never\nhave gotten where I am today without that bit of advice.": "",
  "Take it from me. Don't fight battles you can't win.\nIf I hadn't followed that advice... I wouldn't be where I am now.": "",
  "So you don't think we can beat him?": "",
  "So... you don't think we can beat him?": "",
  "Do you even have a shred of evidence?": "",
  "How? Do you have even a shred\nof evidence?": "",
  "Oh, I suppose you did... but Ichinose-san\ntook it right out of your hands.": "",
  "Oh, I suppose you did...\nbut Ichinose-san took it right out of your hands.": "",
  "Can't you see how weak you are\ncompared to him!?": "",
  "Didn't that make it clear?\nYou're nothing compared to him!": "",
  "You don't have a chance in hell\nof winning this case!": "",
  "You can't win this case!\nYou don't have a chance in hell!": "",
  "Yagami-san. Can you give Okubo\na message for me?": "",
  "Hold on, Yagami-san. When you see Okubo,\ncan you pass along a message?": "",
  "Once he gets out...\nI wanna go visit Emi's grave with him.": "",
  "One day, I wanna go visit Emi's grave\nwith him.": "",
  "That's a pretty big deal.": "",
  "That's a pretty big deal, isn't it?": "",
  "There's a lot we have to take care of before\nwe can even get to that, though.": "",
  "Before we can make that happen...\nWe've got a lot of work left to do.": "",
  "Yeah. Otherwise Okubo'll get executed,\nand never have his name cleared...": "",
  "We'll fix it.\nDon't worry.": "",
  "We'll fix this. Promise.": "",
  "I hope you're right.\nWe can't let him die in there.": "",
  "Yagami-san... Help Okubo. For my sake.": "",
  "Agreed.\nI'll give him the message.": "",
  "I will.\nAnd I'll give him your message.": "",
  "I don't believe this...\nYou're serious?": "",
  "What...? I don't believe this...\nYou're serious?": "",
  "Yeah. He told us his name\nwas Sugiura at first.": "",
  "Yeah. He told us his name was\nSugiura at first.": "",
  "Fumiya-kun... You know,\nI only met him once before Emi's death.": "",
  "Fumiya-kun... I see. You know, I...\nonly met him once before Emi's death.": "",
  "Both of us were a little shy,\nthough, so we didn't really talk.": "",
  "Both of us were a little shy, though...\nso we didn't really talk.": "",
  "I can still remember...\nHow he glared at me during the trial...": "",
  "And then, at the trial... He was there.\nI still remember the hate in his eyes.": "",
  "And how I couldn't even\nlook him in the eye.": "",
  "And... how I couldn't even\nlook back at him.": "",
  "By the way, he told me\nto tell you something.": "",
  "He said he wanted...": "",
  "He wanted you to know...": "",
  "He wants to go out\non the town with you.": "",
  "He wants to go out on\nthe town with you.": "",
  "Huh? Me and Fumiya-kun?\nIn Kamurocho?": "",
  "Huh? In Kamurocho...?\nMe and Fumiya-kun?": "",
  "Yeah. I can show you guys\nsome good spots.": "",
  "I can show you guys some good spots.": "",
  "It's probably been pretty lonely in here these past three years.\nKamurocho's full of places that'll give you \"company\", if you get me.": "",
  "I figure, it's been lonely in here these past three years.\nBut you can always find \"company\" in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Don't worry, just leave it\nto good old Yagami.": "",
  "Don't worry. I gotcha.": "",
  "Er... Something about that...\nSounds a little off...  I don't...": "",
  "Er... even if Fumiya specifically\nasked for that, I'm not sure...": "",
  "Is that really what he\nwanted to say?": "",
  "Is that really what he wanted to say?": "",
  "Well, not exactly.\nHe really said...": "",
  "Well, not exactly. He really said...": "",
  "He wants to kick back\nwith you sometime.": "",
  "Um, what?\nWas he really that casual about it?": "",
  "Um, what? Really...?\nWas he actually that casual about it?": "",
  "I mean, you two were almost\nbrothers-in-law.": "",
  "I mean... you two were\nalmost brothers-in-law, right?": "",
  "I barely ever talked to him, though...": "",
  "I barely ever talked to Fumiya-kun, though.": "",
  "He wants to visit Emi's grave with you.": "",
  "I see. He really wants\nto do that... With me?": "",
  "I see.\nFumiya-kun really... said that?": "",
  "I'd like to take him up on that...": "",
  "I hope I can take\nhim up on that...": "",
  "Ayabe's trial is coming up.": "",
  "We're gonna snare the guy behind AD-9. A man from\nthe Ministry of Health by the name of Ichinose.": "",
  "We're gonna snare the guy behind AD-9.\nA man from the Ministry of Health by the name of Ichinose.": "",
  "Can you do it, though? For real?": "",
  "Can you really do that?\nOn your own?": "",
  "Yeah. The prosecutor's on my side,\ntoo. Ichinose won't stand a chance.": "",
  "Not on my own. The prosecutor's on my side, too.\nThis trial... is going to expose AD-9 for what it is.": "",
  "I'll tell them you're innocent, too.": "",
  "I'll prove that you're innocent, too.": "",
  "I gave up on that a long time ago...": "",
  "I'd already... given up on that.": "",
  "I thought no one would hear me, no matter how loud\nI screamed. Thought I'd die branded a murderer.": "",
  "I thought nobody would hear me, no matter how loud I screamed.\nI thought I'd die in here, branded a murderer.": "",
  "But if Fumiya-kun understands,\nmaybe there's still a chance.": "",
  "But... if Fumiya-kun believes in me,\nmaybe there's still hope.": "",
  "If the guy who hated me most forgives me,\nmaybe everyone else will too.": "",
  "If someone who could hate me so much\nforgives me... Maybe everyone else can too.": "",
  "I'll get you out of here...\nI promise.": "",
  "I'll get you out of here.\nNot much longer now.": "",
  "Welcome back, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hey man.": "",
  "How's the prep going\nfor Ayabe's trial?": "",
  "Still prepping for Ayabe's trial?\nHow's that been going?": "",
  "Not bad. I've gone everywhere\nI wanted to go, at least.": "",
  "Hm? Well, not bad. I've gone everywhere\nin Kamurocho I needed to go, at least.": "",
  "So, you're ready to do this then?\nThere's no going back after this.": "",
  "So, you think you're ready now?": "",
  "Well when you put it like that...": "",
  "When you put it like that...": "",
  "So? You ready to get this rolling?": "",
  "So, everything all ready?\nShould we head out?": "",
  "Uh, give me a few.": "",
  "All right, I'll be here.": "",
  "All right, just lemme know.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm good to go.": "",
  "Yeah. I'm good.": "",
  "How do you feel, Yagami-san? Ready to take this\nto the end? There's no coming back.": "",
  "Yagami-san, you good? Have you done everything\nyou wanna do in Kamurocho?": "",
  "By the way, uh... I just got a call from Hoshino-kun.\nSounded gloomy as hell.": "",
  "Oh, by the way, Hoshino-kun just called,\nand he sounded kinda down...": "",
  "Apparently he wants you to talk to Genda-sensei\nover at the office when you got a minute.": "",
  "Apparently, he wants you at Genda-sensei's office.\nSaid you and Genda-sensei need to talk.": "",
  "He didn't say what about, though.": "",
  "Anyway, I'm just the messenger.\nCatch ya later.": "",
  "...Anyways, there's your message.\nLater.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun said you should go talk\nto Genda-sensei at the office.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun said you should go talk to\nGenda-sensei at the office. Go drop by.": "",
  "Hm? You get called in too?": "",
  "Huh? They call you too?": "",
  "Yup. Just walked in.": "",
  "Yeah, just walked in.": "",
  "Is Hoshino-kun not back yet?": "",
  "Hoshino-kun's not back yet. Okay...": "",
  "Not yet, no.\nIs something the matter?": "",
  "Right. Is something the matter?": "",
  "Nah, not really.": "",
  "Over here, Yagami.": "",
  "Something you wanted\nto discuss, Genda-sensei?": "",
  "Hey, Genda-sensei.\nThere's something you wanted to talk to me about?": "",
  "No, not me. Him.": "",
  "Well... it's him, not me.": "",
  "Prosecutor Izumida...": "",
  "They've got men monitoring every\nnook and cranny of your agency.": "",
  "They've got men monitoring your\nagency from top to bottom.": "",
  "I figured it'd be safer to talk here.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If Izumida came all the way out to Genda's office\njust to talk, then that must mean...)</color>": "",
  "More bad news?": "",
  "Is that how you treat a guest?\nAnd no, it's good news.": "",
  "Must you be so high-strung?\nAnd no... it's good news.": "",
  "Guess it can't be all bad.": "",
  "Guess it can't <font_kind=yakuza_italic>all</font_kind> be bad.": "",
  "Ichinose will testify at the trial.": "",
  "...Ichinose will testify at the trial.": "",
  "So you convinced him, huh?\nRun into any trouble?": "",
  "No. It went fairly smoothly.": "",
  "No. It all went smoothly.": "",
  "So you want me to explain AD-9?": "",
  "I'd have to explain AD-9?\nNothing more?": "",
  "Yes, at the upcoming trial.": "",
  "And by that you mean the one\nfor the murdered lawyer?": "",
  "The trial in question... being the one for\nthat Kamurocho lawyer's death?": "",
  "That's right. Before his death, \nthat lawyer made a phone call to Dr. Shono.": "",
  "This lawyer, Shintani, made a call before his death.\nIt was apparently to Dr. Shono.": "",
  "Of course, we have no reason to believe\nthat call had anything to do with the killing.": "",
  "Of course, the call likely had nothing to do\nwith his death.": "",
  "Dr. Shono and AD-9, involved in a murder?\nIt's quite far-fetched, if you ask me.": "",
  "After all, he died in Kamurocho. It's hard to imagine\nDr. Shono or AD-9 are involved.": "",
  "A preposterous notion.": "",
  "Indeed.": "",
  "However, that doesn't change the fact\nthat the call was made.": "",
  "However... that doesn't change the fact\nthat the call was made.": "",
  "And so, we'll need to explain in court\njust why it can't be related.": "",
  "Ah, well...": "",
  "You won't need to say a word about the call itself.\nJust explain the situation.": "",
  "You won't need to say a word about the call itself.\nJust explain AD-9, and a bit of its context.": "",
  "AD-9 is a drug of global importance, and Dr. Shono\nand his team have put immense effort into its development.": "",
  "Dr. Shono and his team have spared no effort\ndeveloping this vital new drug.": "",
  "Once you've explained,\nI'm sure it will clear the air.": "",
  "Once you've explained the particulars,\neveryone will understand, I'm sure.": "",
  "Yes, I see. I'm not sure I can portray it accurately,\nthough. I'm not a scientist, after all.": "",
  "Yes, I see. Though I'm not sure I can explain it all,\nas I'm no scientist...": "",
  "If you would be more comfortable, we could always\ncall Dr. Shono to the stand.": "",
  "If it would make you more comfortable,\nwe can always call on Dr. Shono himself.": "",
  "But his language may in fact be too complicated.\nI'm not sure our jurors would understand.": "",
  "Just... his language may in fact be <font_kind=yakuza_italic>too</font_kind> complicated.\nI'm not sure our jurors would understand.": "",
  "If possible, I'd prefer it were you\nup there, Ichinose-san.": "",
  "You have a point. It would be foolish to take up\nDr. Shono's time with such an insignificant matter.": "",
  "True... it would be foolish to waste Dr. Shono's time\non such an insignificant matter.": "",
  "Very well, I'll do it. Contact the Ministry of Health\nwhen the trial date is decided.": "",
  "Thank you very much, sir.": "",
  "If you'll excuse me.\nI have another meeting to get to.": "",
  "Excuse me. I have another meeting\nto get to.": "",
  "Nice going. You made it sound like if Ichinose\ndidn't testify, Shono would.": "",
  "Nice play. Dangling testimony from\nShono in front of him was smart.": "",
  "It worked.": "",
  "Ichinose didn't wanna risk Shono\ngetting in there and slipping up.": "",
  "Ichinose wouldn't risk Shono\ngetting in there and slipping up.": "",
  "Can't trust anyone to do it but himself.": "",
  "Can't trust anyone to do it\nbut himself.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Good. The boss is on the hook.\nNow the fight begins.)</color>": "",
  "Good work, Izumida. Turns out you can be\npretty devious when you wanna be.": "",
  "You really came through, Izumida.\nYou're pretty devious when you wanna be.": "",
  "Devious? Really?": "",
  "What? Devious?": "",
  "Kidding. Really, I can't thank you enough.\nWe'll have Ichinose out in the open thanks to you.": "",
  "Kidding. Really, I can't thank you enough. Thanks to you,\nwe'll have Ichinose out in the open.": "",
  "All we have to do now\nis find a way to corner him.": "",
  "What about Hamura, from the Matsugane Family?\nCan we ask him to testify?": "",
  "He's still on the run. Guy couldn't even be bothered\nto come to his patriarch's funeral.": "",
  "He's still missing in action.\nDidn't even come to his patriarch's funeral.": "",
  "Of course not.\nHow could he after what he did?": "",
  "Of course not. How could he\nafter what he did?": "",
  "Hey, I got an idea. Why don't we just grab Kuroiwa\nand get him to confess to being the Mole!?": "",
  "Hey, why don't we just grab Kuroiwa?\nGet him to confess he's the Mole?": "",
  "You do remember the beating\nhe gave you last time, right?": "",
  "After the beating he gave you?": "",
  "I let my guard down, that's all!": "",
  "He just caught me by surprise, okay!?": "",
  "Cut it out, you two.": "",
  "Come on, guys.\nWe've got Ichinose right where we want him.": "",
  "Come on, guys. We've got Ichinose\nright where we want him.": "",
  "We just need to figure out what to do next.\nYou're not gonna win empty-handed, you know.": "",
  "Ayabe's casino is getting\nraided by the police.": "",
  "They're at Ayabe's casino.\nThe police are raiding it.": "",
  "L'Amant? Now?": "",
  "L'Amant? Right now?": "",
  "Yeah, they just started.\nMorita is setting the wheels in motion.": "",
  "Yeah, they just started.\nMorita's setting up his argument.": "",
  "They've already arrested\nmost of the employees.": "",
  "I get it.\nIt's a character assassination.": "",
  "I get it.\nThey're out to smear Ayabe's reputation.": "",
  "A crooked cop running an illegal casino...\nNo surprise if he commits a murder, too.": "",
  "A crooked cop running an illegal casino...\nMurder's the next logical step, right?": "",
  "The chief prosecutor\nis hitting us where it hurts.": "",
  "The chief prosecutor is hitting us\nwhere it hurts.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess they're not gonna\ngo down without a fight.)</color>": "",
  "Just wanted to give you a heads up.": "",
  "Just wanted to let you know.": "",
  "So... how's it looking, Yagami-kun?\nDo you think you can win?": "",
  "So, Yagami-kun?\nDo you think you can win?": "",
  "I'll do the best I can. The good news is,\nI have a lot of help. Thanks for the call, Mafuyu.": "",
  "I'll do the best I can. The good news is, I have a lot of help.\nThanks for the call, Mafuyu.": "",
  "Of course.\nSee you.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Yeah, I'm good to go.": "อืม ฉันพร้อมแล้ว",
  "Indeed.": "ใช่แล้ว",
  "Thank you very much, sir.": "ขอบคุณมากค่ะ"
 }
}
